{"id":"f0b0edbaa6696a1d","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-variety.md","title":"Variety","display":"df-variety — Variety","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-variety","aliases":["93-df-variety"],"display":"df-variety — Variety","depends_on":["[[93-df-equational-class]]","[[93-df-closure-operators]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-variety"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-variety</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-variety — Variety"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"55094a403a51c25e\" href=\"?note=55094a403a51c25e\" title=\"93-df-equational-class\">93-df-equational-class</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"97b46a497e251f9f\" href=\"?note=97b46a497e251f9f\" title=\"93-df-closure-operators\">93-df-closure-operators</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> is fixed, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal K\">\\(\\mathcal K\\)</span> are class candidates, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EqClass}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{EqClass}_{93}\\)</span> is from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"55094a403a51c25e\" href=\"?note=55094a403a51c25e\" title=\"93-df-equational-class\">93-df-equational-class</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Variety}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Variety}_{93}\\)</span> and the generated-variety operator <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{VGen}_{93,\\tau}\">\\(\\operatorname{VGen}_{93,\\tau}\\)</span> are defined here.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>生成算子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{VGen}_{93,\\tau}\">\\(\\operatorname{VGen}_{93,\\tau}\\)</span> 的定义域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SimType}_{93}(\\tau)\">\\(\\mathrm{SimType}_{93}(\\tau)\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\{\\mathbf A:\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\}\">\\(\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\{\\mathbf A:\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Variety}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Variety}_{93}\\)</span> 仍保留原候选类上的谓词定义。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Eq}_{\\tau}(\\mathrm{Var}_{93})\">\\(\\mathrm{Eq}_{\\tau}(\\mathrm{Var}_{93})\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"55094a403a51c25e\" href=\"?note=55094a403a51c25e\" title=\"93-df-equational-class\">93-df-equational-class</a> 所使用的等式集，其元素为相同相似类型上的项对；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models^{\\mathrm{eq}}_{\\tau,\\mathrm{Var}_{93}}\">\\(\\models^{\\mathrm{eq}}_{\\tau,\\mathrm{Var}_{93}}\\)</span> 取该文件的全赋值等式满足关系，语法和语义均保留完整参数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau,\\mathrm{Var}_{93}\">\\(\\tau,\\mathrm{Var}_{93}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}variety}\\vdash\\mathrm{Variety}_{93}(\\mathcal V;\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{EqClass}_{93}(\\mathcal V,\\tau)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}variety}\\vdash\\mathrm{Variety}_{93}(\\mathcal V;\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{EqClass}_{93}(\\mathcal V,\\tau)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}variety}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{VGen}_{93,\\tau}(\\mathcal K)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\mathbf A:\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\land\n\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathrm{Eq}_{\\tau}(\\mathrm{Var}_{93})\\;\n\\left[\\left(\\forall\\mathbf B\\in\\mathcal K\\;\n\\mathbf B\\models^{\\mathrm{eq}}_{\\tau,\\mathrm{Var}_{93}}\\varepsilon\\right)\n\\to\\mathbf A\\models^{\\mathrm{eq}}_{\\tau,\\mathrm{Var}_{93}}\\varepsilon\\right]\\right\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}variety}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{VGen}_{93,\\tau}(\\mathcal K)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\mathbf A:\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\land\n\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathrm{Eq}_{\\tau}(\\mathrm{Var}_{93})\\;\n\\left[\\left(\\forall\\mathbf B\\in\\mathcal K\\;\n\\mathbf B\\models^{\\mathrm{eq}}_{\\tau,\\mathrm{Var}_{93}}\\varepsilon\\right)\n\\to\\mathbf A\\models^{\\mathrm{eq}}_{\\tau,\\mathrm{Var}_{93}}\\varepsilon\\right]\\right\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SimType}_{93}(\\tau)\\land\n\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\{\\mathbf A:\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\}\\to{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Variety}_{93}(\\operatorname{VGen}_{93,\\tau}(\\mathcal K);\\tau)\n\\land\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\operatorname{VGen}_{93,\\tau}(\\mathcal K)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\mathcal V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Variety}_{93}(\\mathcal V;\\tau)\n\\land\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\mathcal V\\to\n\\operatorname{VGen}_{93,\\tau}(\\mathcal K)\\subseteq\\mathcal V\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SimType}_{93}(\\tau)\\land\n\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\{\\mathbf A:\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\}\\to{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Variety}_{93}(\\operatorname{VGen}_{93,\\tau}(\\mathcal K);\\tau)\n\\land\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\operatorname{VGen}_{93,\\tau}(\\mathcal K)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\mathcal V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Variety}_{93}(\\mathcal V;\\tau)\n\\land\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\mathcal V\\to\n\\operatorname{VGen}_{93,\\tau}(\\mathcal K)\\subseteq\\mathcal V\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>Variety₉₃ 仍是 EqClass₉₃ 的精确别名。生成算子的值仍为包含输入类的最小簇；外延式避免把真类当作集合元素。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-equational-class","status":"resolved","id":"55094a403a51c25e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-equational-class]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-closure-operators","status":"resolved","id":"97b46a497e251f9f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-closure-operators]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-equational-class","status":"resolved","id":"55094a403a51c25e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\tau$ is fixed, $\\mathcal V$ and $\\mathcal K$ are class candidates, and $\\mathrm{EqClass}_{93}$ is from [[93-df-equational-class]].","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-equational-class","status":"resolved","id":"55094a403a51c25e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Eq}_{\\tau}(\\mathrm{Var}_{93})$ 是 [[93-df-equational-class]] 所使用的等式集，其元素为相同相似类型上的项对；$\\models^{\\mathrm{eq}}_{\\tau,\\mathrm{Var}_{93}}$ 取该文件的全赋值等式满足关系，语法和语义均保留完整参数 $\\tau,\\mathrm{Var}_{93}$。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal K","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EqClass}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Variety}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{VGen}_{93,\\tau}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{VGen}_{93,\\tau}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SimType}_{93}(\\tau)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\{\\mathbf A:\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Variety}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Eq}_{\\tau}(\\mathrm{Var}_{93})","display":false},{"tex":"\\models^{\\mathrm{eq}}_{\\tau,\\mathrm{Var}_{93}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau,\\mathrm{Var}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}variety}\\vdash\\mathrm{Variety}_{93}(\\mathcal V;\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{EqClass}_{93}(\\mathcal V,\\tau)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}variety}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{VGen}_{93,\\tau}(\\mathcal K)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\mathbf A:\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\land\n\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathrm{Eq}_{\\tau}(\\mathrm{Var}_{93})\\;\n\\left[\\left(\\forall\\mathbf B\\in\\mathcal K\\;\n\\mathbf B\\models^{\\mathrm{eq}}_{\\tau,\\mathrm{Var}_{93}}\\varepsilon\\right)\n\\to\\mathbf A\\models^{\\mathrm{eq}}_{\\tau,\\mathrm{Var}_{93}}\\varepsilon\\right]\\right\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SimType}_{93}(\\tau)\\land\n\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\{\\mathbf A:\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\}\\to{}&\n\\mathrm{Variety}_{93}(\\operatorname{VGen}_{93,\\tau}(\\mathcal K);\\tau)\n\\land\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\operatorname{VGen}_{93,\\tau}(\\mathcal K)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall\\mathcal V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Variety}_{93}(\\mathcal V;\\tau)\n\\land\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\mathcal V\\to\n\\operatorname{VGen}_{93,\\tau}(\\mathcal K)\\subseteq\\mathcal V\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":2227,"backlinks":[{"id":"47e441115dc87ddf","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f9827304d8968c8c","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"60f9a1c1bcd5e07c","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{VGen}_{93,\\tau}$ and $\\mathrm{HSP}$ are the operators of [[93-df-variety]] and [[93-df-closure-operators]]."},{"id":"a015fcd24d4b916f","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"